          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMenahemu wayeseyichitha iThifsa nakho konke okwakukulo, nomkhawulo wayo kusukela eTirisa; ngenxa yokuthi abamvulelanga, ngakho wabanqoba; futhi bonke abakhulelweyo ababekulo wabadabula.",
