        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wamashumi amathathu nesishiyagalolunye ka-Azariya inkosi yakwaJuda uMenahemu indodana kaGadi waba yinkosi phezu kuka-Israyeli, wabusa eSamariya iminyaka eyishumi.",
